 below. \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\,\\boxed{}\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression?" 13194139535826 17592186045443 true] [17592186530731 1072 #uuid "f013a55f-b50b-519d-a1ee-bdf3c4905ad2" 13194139535826 17592186045443 true] [17592186530731 1074 "For a surface $S$ defined by $z=g(x,y)$ with $(x,y)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f(x,y,z)$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFor the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂x}=\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- x^{2} - x y + 2 y^{2})=- 2 x - y,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- x^{2} - x y + 2 y^{2})=- x + 4 y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+(- 2 x - y)^2+(- x + 4 y)^2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(x (- x^{2} - x y + 2 y^{2}) - y (- x^{2} - x y + 2 y^{2})^{2})\\cdot (\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x + 4 y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(- x^{4} y - 2 x^{3} y^{2} - x^{3} + 3 x^{2} y^{3} - x^{2} y + 4 x y^{4} + 2 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})\\cdot (\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x + 4 y)^{2} + 1})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\,\\sqrt{(- 2 x - y)^{2} + (- x + 4 y)^{2} + 1} (- x^{4} y - 2 x^{3} y^{2} - x^{3} + 3 x^{2} y^{3} - x^{2} y + 4 x y^{4} + 2 x y^{2} - 4 y^{5})\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535826 17592186045443 true] [17592186530732 1068 #edb/ref 17592186530666 13194139535826 17592186045443 true] [17592186530732 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535826 17592186045443 true] [17592186530732 1071 "Consider the surface integral of the function $f(x,y,z)=- x z,$ where the surface $S$ is defined by $z=- 2 x^{2} + 2 x y + 2 y^{2}$ for $0\\le x\\le 2$